{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-js","path":"/blog/2024-10-21-how-to-change-radio-button-shape-in-react-js/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"excerpt":"Hi Friends 👋, Welcome To aHoisting! To change radio button shape in react js, you can set  in  . It will change radio button shape in react js. Today, I am…","html":"<p>Hi Friends 👋,</p>\n<p>Welcome To aHoisting!</p>\n<p>To change radio button shape in react js, you can set <code class=\"language-text\">border-radius: 4px;</code> in  <code class=\"language-text\">.custom-radio + label:before</code>. It will change radio button shape in react js.</p>\n<p>Today, I am going to show you, how to change radio button shape in react js.</p>\n<p>Table of contents</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Install and create a new React app.</li>\n<li>Import react component.</li>\n<li>Create a Component.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Let’s start with the first step.</p>\n<h2>Step 1: Install and create a new React app.</h2>\n<p>First you have to install the React project. You should use <code class=\"language-text\">create-react-app</code> command to create a new React project.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\">npx create<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>react<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app my<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app\ncd my<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app\nnpm start</code></pre></div>\n<h2>Step 2: Import react component.</h2>\n<p>After installing, you have to import your React component.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> React <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"react\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"./App.css\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>Step 3: Create a Component.</h2>\n<p>You can use <code class=\"language-text\">className=\"custom-radio\"</code> to change radio button shape in react js.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>input type<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"radio\"</span> id<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"radio1\"</span> name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"example\"</span> className<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"custom-radio\"</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>label htmlFor<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"radio1\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>Option <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>label<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n\n  <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>input type<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"radio\"</span> id<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"radio2\"</span> name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"example\"</span> className<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"custom-radio\"</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>label htmlFor<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"radio2\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>Option <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>label<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>Change radio button shape example.</h2>\n<p>The below code is an example of a React. You have to import <code class=\"language-text\">\"./App.css\"</code> and set <code class=\"language-text\">border-radius: 4px;</code> in  <code class=\"language-text\">.custom-radio + label:before</code> to change radio button shape in react js.</p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">App.js</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> React <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"react\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"./App.css\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">App</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>input type<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"radio\"</span> id<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"radio1\"</span> name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"example\"</span> className<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"custom-radio\"</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>label htmlFor<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"radio1\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>Option <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>label<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>input type<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"radio\"</span> id<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"radio2\"</span> name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"example\"</span> className<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"custom-radio\"</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>label htmlFor<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"radio2\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>Option <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>label<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">default</span> App<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">App.css</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"css\"><pre class=\"language-css\"><code class=\"language-css\">  <span class=\"token selector\">.custom-radio</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">display</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> none<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> \n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n  \n  <span class=\"token selector\">.custom-radio + label</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">position</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> relative<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">padding-left</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 25px<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">cursor</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> pointer<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">user-select</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> none<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n  \n  <span class=\"token selector\">.custom-radio + label:before</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">content</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">''</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">position</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> absolute<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">left</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 0<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">top</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 0<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">width</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 15px<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">height</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 15px<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">border-radius</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 4px<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> \n    <span class=\"token property\">border</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 2px solid #999<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">background-color</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> #fff<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n  \n  <span class=\"token selector\">.custom-radio:checked + label:before</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">background-color</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> #3498db<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">border-color</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> #3498db<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>In the above code example, I have used the <code class=\"language-text\">border-radius: 4px;</code> to change radio button shape in react js.</p>\n<p>Check the output of the above code.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 358px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/037c9adc115d450977d3b4a6070daf60/44bcf/radio-button-shape.webp\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 67.72151898734178%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/webp;base64,UklGRlAAAABXRUJQVlA4IEQAAABwAwCdASoUAA4APtFapEwoJSOiMAgBABoJQBYdhDw0a9kYeEAA+p/lG5Rlba5ZlHOEeUB8jp2cL/LcX4DtnZSFzbdAAA=='); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"React, radio, button, shape\"\n        title=\"React, radio, button, shape\"\n        src=\"/static/037c9adc115d450977d3b4a6070daf60/44bcf/radio-button-shape.webp\"\n        srcset=\"/static/037c9adc115d450977d3b4a6070daf60/81b7c/radio-button-shape.webp 158w,\n/static/037c9adc115d450977d3b4a6070daf60/6ea66/radio-button-shape.webp 315w,\n/static/037c9adc115d450977d3b4a6070daf60/44bcf/radio-button-shape.webp 358w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 358px) 100vw, 358px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>All the best 👍</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"How to change radio button shape in react js?","tags":["React"],"date":"October 21, 2024","description":"Example of change radio button shape in react js with step by step tutorial - aHoisting","social_image":{"absolutePath":"/Users/mac/Documents/hoisting/ahoisting/static/media/template/reactjs.jpg"}}},"prev":{"frontmatter":{"title":"How to change radio button text color in react js?"},"fields":{"slug":"/blog/2024-10-21-how-to-change-radio-button-text-color-in-react-js/"}},"next":{"frontmatter":{"title":"How to change radio button color in react js?"},"fields":{"slug":"/blog/2024-10-20-how-to-change-radio-button-color-in-react-js/"}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/blog/2024-10-21-how-to-change-radio-button-shape-in-react-js/","prevSlug":"/blog/2024-10-21-how-to-change-radio-button-text-color-in-react-js/","nextSlug":"/blog/2024-10-20-how-to-change-radio-button-color-in-react-js/"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2555585279","2714594843","3159585216"]}